<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELBODEN, Switzerland 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings</p>
<p>after the first leg of a men's World Cup giant slalom on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>1. Michael von Gruenigen (Switzerland) one minute, 10.31 seconds</p>
<p>2. Hans Knaus (Austria) 1:10.43</p>
<p>3. Rainer Salzgeber (Austria) 1:10.59</p>
<p>4. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway) 1:10.64</p>
<p>5. Siegfried Voglreiter (Austria) 1:10.88</p>
<p>6. Heinz Schilchegger (Austria) 1:10.89</p>
<p>7. Alois Vogl (Germany) 1:11.05</p>
<p>8. Lasse Kjus (Norway) 1:11.11</p>
<p>9. Paul Accola (Switzerland) 1:11.19</p>
<p>10. Guenther Mader (Austria) 1:11.21</p>
</text>
